        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho mutu yeyesi akalondwa kulavya ushaidi kpwenye baraza dzulu ya dzambo ariroriona au kusikira, na achirema kugomba chitu, andakala akahenda dambi na andaripha kpwa ajili ya dambi hiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au napho mutu yeyesi kahi yenu achidzinajisi bila kumanya kpwa kuguta chitu chochosi chiricho najisi, ikale ni lufu ra nyama wa tsakani au ra mfugo au ra nyama a kuambala na photsi, andakala najisi, na ni mkosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au mutu achiguta chitu chochosi kula kpwa mwanadamu chinachoisabiwa kukala najisi bila kumanya, chindamuhenda akale najisi, phahi, ndiphomanya andakala na makosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au, napho mutu achiapa kuhenda chitu chochosi, chinono au chii, dza vira atu ahendavyo bila kufikiriya, ndiphomanya andakala mkpwosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, mutu achikala mkpwosa kuhusu dzambo mwengarapho ra higo ni lazima akubali dambiye ariyohenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ni amrehere Mwenyezi Mlungu ngʼondzi chetu au mbuzi chetu kula kpwenye mifugoye dza maripho kpwa ajili ya dambi ariyohenda ailavye ikale sadaka ya kuusa dambi. Naye mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera upatanisho kpwa kumuusira dambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela napho kana uwezo wa kulavya ngʼondzi au mbuzi dza maripho kpwa dambi ariyohenda, phahi andamrehera Mwenyezi Mlungu njiya airi au ana njiya manga airi, mmwenga kpwa ajili ya sadaka ya kuusa dambi na wanjina kpwa ajili ya sadaka ya kuochwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andaareha kpwa mlavyadzi-sadaka, naye mlavyadzi-sadaka andamlavya mmwenga kpwandza akale sadaka ya kuusa dambi kpwa kummwamula chitswa bila kuusa chitswache kabisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu ya milatsoye andaitimvya-timvya uphande mmwenga wa phatu pha kulavira sadaka na hira yanjina andaitweneza-tweneza photsi kpwenye hako ra phatu pha kulavira sadaka. Iyo ni sadaka ya kuusa dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu andamlavya yuya wa phiri kukala sadaka ya kuochwa kulengana na malagizo. Mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera yuya mutu upatanisho kpwa kumuusira dambiye, naye andaswamehewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ichikala kana uwezo wa kulavya hata njiya airi au ana njiya manga airi dza sadakaye ya kuusa dambi ariyohenda, phahi, andareha unga mnono kilo mwenga. Ela kandautiya mafuha wala ubani mana ni sadaka ya kuusa dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andamrehera mlavyadzi-sadaka, naye andahala unga hinyo fumba mwenga na kuuocha dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka kuonyesa kukala sadaka yosi ni ya Mwenyezi Mlungu phamwenga na sadaka alavirwazo Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa kuochwa. Iyo ni sadaka ya kuusa dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera yuya mutu upatanisho kpwa kumuusira dambi, naye andaswamehewa. Unga uchiosala undakala wa mlavyadzi-sadaka dza vira inavyohendeka wakati wa kulavya sadaka ya mtsere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu waenderera kugomba na Musa achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho mutu yeyesi akakosa kpwa kuhenda dambi bila kumanya kuhusu kusalavya vitu ambavyo ni vilavirwe Mwenyezi Mlungu, andamrehera turume risirokala na chirema dza maripho kpwa makosage kula kpwa mifugoye. Au undapima beiye kulengana na chipimo cha Phatu Phatakatifu. Iyo ni sadaka ya kuusa makosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya higo, yuya mutu andaripha vitu ambavyo kala ni alavye kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu ambavyo kavilavire na aenjereze seemu mwenga ya tsano ya beiye na kumupha mlavyadzi-sadaka. Phahi, mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera upatanisho kpwa kumuusira dambi kuhumira hiro turume ambaro rindakala sadaka ya kuusa makosa, naye andaswamehewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutu yeyesi achihenda dambi bila kumanya, kpwa kuvundza lagizo mwengarapho ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, iye ni mkpwosa, na andaripha kpwa ajili ya kosare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andamrehera mlavyadzi-sadaka turume risirokala na chirema kula kpwa mifugoye au samaniye ya pesa kpwa ikale sadaka ya kuusa makosa. Naye mlavyadzi-sadaka andamuhendera upatanisho kpwa kumuusira dambi ariyohenda bila kumanya, naye andaswamehewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ni sadaka ya kuusa makosa, kpwa kukala iye ni mkpwosa mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
